    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e6ebb44fe7e2ed122df1",
      "document_start": 717,
      "document_end": 761,
      "text": "定量级，在数学上称这种系统具有刚性性质，描述这类变化过程的常微分方程系统则称为刚性系统。",
      "section_id": "section_043f5f7f082c"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_50f01f0f708e0ec92e47",
      "document_start": 761,
      "document_end": 779,
      "text": "刚性方程也称为病态方程或坏条件方程。",
      "section_id": "section_043f5f7f082c"
